    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But it's not just about the kingdom... it's the noise in my head, Elara. Every time I close my eyes, I see their faces. The screams. It's like I'm being punished for surviving when they didn't. I've tried to be strong like you say, but the weight is just... it's too much. I feel like I'm just waiting for the end anyway. Is there even any dignity in living like this?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
