      "content": "I don't want clarity... I just want the silence. Not the strength, just the quiet. It feels like every breath I take is just another way of hurting everyone who loved me. If I stayed, I'd just be a ghost walking through these ruins. Wouldn't it be more honorable to just... let the fire finish what it started? To find some peace instead of dragging this shame around forever?",
